<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-19T13:38:42.814Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:38:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army is advancing toward RSF strongholds in West Kordofan and the Blue Nile while RSF drone strikes have killed at least 1,630 civilians at markets, hospitals and fuel sites, prompting Amnesty International to call for war crimes investigations into attacks on El Obeid. Courts have sentenced RSF chief Hemedti and 13 others to death in absentia, and a separate court also sentenced the head of the RSF to death in absentia. RSF commander and troops have switched sides to join the Sudanese army. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOanJDcTk5YlN0UW5zQ1lDVEF1LXkwVDBCTUNlU1dJMUdudm5vRGN0Tno3SXZ3NEprcVUycHNZWXZPSjZRSGk2a1QxT01HSzd4TXN6RmtKRFBXeXV3Q0JqS1NILUZ6dDZ1V2lvcmRHa3l6ZjJUcUoyS0pWanZxR1RyOUZtMEt4Y21CMnZnam9YX1VsNlpXTnZmLXRISG00UHhXSkRrRlpZUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dabanga Radio TV Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Arab&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNZWMzeE5STGJLQVZieDl3V0s3NkJnYk90ZzZEVXAtYTBQWXhuVld4TFZSNnE2cU5qcV9KT01TTm1YeFRHc3NWR3VSR1pLcGZ6WTVxZzdxM0p6SjdXMkw0T2VjdVlucEg1QlZaVUtsYUVVV1NGY0V4V1ZmZFpyT2gzNzhDejc4VlpKZE5JazdmeDBYa2xoZWQ1amM0akMwMXd1ZnNTVHBSUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;horn review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNdzBZc0NhUkJOUXVXdVhnV0ptQ0xab3ZDTGMzQ2hNRVlpWUg1d0FhVzZtSk5VWHYydzFkcmw2dVBpWTBjMEstR2xmYnhvOVpkWU1zQTBoNDVvVy1TTVRJNm95ZHItMlBMVjN3Rksta04wcGtsNWR0enVzRHV4MzJJb3MxZ3BJQzhkSmJj?oc=5&quot;&gt;horn review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBhLU1IUXFaYkFUZmZDb3dYNk9qLTdFYV90Y1JYZWlmeWhNeGRXNDVjQnVUQkdLLVFxcXc5V0hpLWk1d0xXTERnaTlUZW1lX0NKbS1NWmtYTQ?oc=5